{"ref":"BDB, רֶ֫קֶם","hw":"רֶ֫קֶם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רֶ֫קֶם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> m. </strong> <strong>a.</strong>  a king of Midian <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:8\" href=\"/Numbers.31.8\">Nu 31:8</a> (Ροκομ), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:21\" href=\"/Joshua.13.21\">Jos 13:21</a> (Ροβοκ, A Ροκομ, 𝔊 Οροκομ). <strong>b.</strong>  a ‘son’ of Hebron <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.43\">1 Ch 2:43</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:44\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.44\">44</a>, Ρεκομ, Ροκομ, Ρωκημ. <strong>c.</strong>  name in Gilead <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.16\">1 Ch 7:16</a>, 𝔊L Ρακαμ.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> loc.</strong> in Benj., <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:27\" href=\"/Joshua.18.27\">Jos 18:27</a>, Νακαν, A 𝔊L Ρεκεμ[ν].","next":"BDB, רָקַע","prev":"BDB, רִקְמָה"}